. 
. * 将回归结果写入 CSV
. clear

. set obs 1
Number of observations (_N) was 0, now 1.

. gen term = "digital"

. gen coefficient = `b_digital'

. gen se = `se_digital'

. gen tstat = `t_digital'

. gen pvalue = `p_digital'

. gen stars = "`stars'"

. gen r2 = `r2'

. gen r2_within = `r2_within'

. gen N = `N'

. gen df_r = `df_r'

. 
. export delimited using "output/stata_did_results.csv", replace
file output/stata_did_results.csv saved

. display "DID 回归结果已保存到 output/stata_did_results.csv"
DID 回归结果已保存到 output/stata_did_results.csv

